<title>PERU: Banco de Credito approves cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Banco de Credito approves cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's leading bank, Banco de Credito, approved a cash dividend of 0.10 sol per share based on 1996 profits, the Lima Stock Exchange said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The exchange said in its daily report that the record date is April 2 and the payout April 14.</p>
<p>The dividend will total 59 million soles, it added.</p>
<p>Banco de Credito is 90.1 percent-owned by financial holding Credicorp Ltd.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
